<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-050" chapter-id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations" source-id="s-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations-ws2371899">
  <p id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">孝建元年，南郡王<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0008" ref="9df_923_1a1">義宣</persName>反，兗州刺史<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0016" ref="zwg_0uh_w1u">徐遺寶</persName>，<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0020" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">護之</persName>妻弟也，遠相連結，與<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0032" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">護之</persName>書，勸使同逆。<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0041" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">護之</persName>馳使以聞。<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0048" ref="zwg_0uh_w1u">遺寶</persName>時戍湖陸，<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0055" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">護之</persName>留子<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0059" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AAB">恭祖</persName>守歷城，自率步騎襲<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0070" ref="zwg_0uh_w1u">遺寶</persName>。道經鄒山，破其別戍。未至湖陸六十里，<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p001:m0091" ref="zwg_0uh_w1u">遺寶</persName>焚城西走。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p002:m0000" ref="f3x_mii_8ax">柳元景</persName>率<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p002:m0004" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">護之</persName>及<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p002:m0007" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">護之</persName>弟<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p002:m0010" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AB">詢之</persName>、柳叔仁、鄭琨等諸軍，出鎮新亭。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p003:m0001" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AAA">承祖</persName>嗣。<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p003:m0005" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AAA">承祖</persName>卒，子<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p003:m0010" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AAAA">顯宗</persName>嗣。齊受禪，國除。<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p003:m0021" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">護之</persName>次子<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p003:m0025" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AAB">恭祖</persName>，勇果有父風。太宗泰始初，以軍功為梁、南秦二州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p004:m0000" ref="av0_ly9_952">遵</persName>子<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p004:m0002" ref="av0_ly9_952_A">閬</persName>，元嘉中，為員外散騎侍郎。母墓為東阿寺道人<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p004:m0024" ref="r8r_y2a_mif">曇洛</persName>等所發，<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p004:m0030" ref="av0_ly9_952_A">閬</persName>與弟殿中將軍<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p004:m0037" ref="av0_ly9_952_B">閎</persName>共殺<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p004:m0040" ref="r8r_y2a_mif">曇洛</persName>等五人，詣官歸罪，見原。<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p004:m0054" ref="av0_ly9_952_A">閬</persName>，大明三年，自義興太守為寧朔將軍、兗州刺史，為竟陵王<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-family-continuations:p004:m0081" ref="9d4_1cb_fb9">誕</persName>所殺。追贈征虜將軍，刺史如故。</p>
</text>
